{"data":{"body":"**P2:** `root.end()` and `forceFlush()` share one cleanup block, so a nonfatal exception from a root `SpanProcessor.onEnd` skips the flush. `PluginRunner` then isolates that exception, allowing the invocation to succeed while batched Invocation/Workflow spans remain unflushed before Lambda freezes. Run the flush in a `finally` for nonfatal root-end failures while preserving the existing fatal precedence; apply the same fix to `ExecutionOtelPlugin` and test with a throwing root processor plus `BatchSpanProcessor`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772w2o","finding_digest":"865dacd7ad0262bace7a3ae73f3b03fe576bd9cf33ed167154405b3aa264d443","finding_id":"arf_v1_qzo2zv5najrlvtt2hltt6oyd7z","finding_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/invocationotelplugin.java::oninvocationend::root-end-skips-flush","identity_key":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/invocationotelplugin.java::oninvocationend::root-end-skips-flush","line":296,"observation_digest":"8ec2a46571821fbc777bb6ea148a28da930aba07cd7039d84b055b90690a2418","observation_id":"aro_v1_r3bkizlrqip3y533w3vbjcri3k","path":"otel-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/otel/InvocationOtelPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-09T00:17:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bjy43jiupfo56ejqexsqsf3lxe","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2adc34c4d51c6f4dc566985cb74ad6c24bae61f1","reviewer":"codex","start_line":295,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":767},"record_id":"art_v1_gb264w2v6646wml5z3yv4jotlv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T00:17:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
